  "third_party_unpacker": "The reviewed public parser slices offset:offset+size with no loader-specific base handling. This misplaces loader1/loader2/loader3 and causes the table-tail false positive. For remaining partitions the +0x200 convention is supported by image-end and plaintext hash checks, but loader1-3 are a special contiguous cluster beginning at 0x1600. Do not infer that one offset base applies to all entries.",
  "conclusion": "Corrected static extraction identifies loader1/2/3 data locations and falsifies the purported cleartext loader2 manifest. This is a package-layout correction, not decryption. No code semantics, cryptographic key, execution path, or firmware modification is recovered."
